<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks rose, four fell and nine were flat in nine-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday, with the WIG 20 index closing 1.3 percent lower at 1,589.1 points.</p>
<p>The remaining two stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.7 percent to 149 zlotys in a 12.6-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
